  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">4RD Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a digital platform called the Carbon Value Exchange (CaVEx) that will facilitate the collection and aggregation of data for small scale climate positive activities to allow for the creation of carbon credits. CaVEx will also enable buyers or investors in climate action to purchase these carbon credits from small scale projects on an aggregated or unit basis using digital payments. Proceeds from the sale of carbon credits will be digitally transferred to the individuals involved in the small-scale actions, thus greatly improving access to climate finance for smaller projects that sequester or avoid carbon emissions and are currently excluded from accessing climate finance</narrative>
  </description>
